@startuml
participant "AgentManager" as AM
participant "CheckpointManager" as CM
database "runs/{run_id}/checkpoints/latest.json" as Latest
database "runs/{run_id}/checkpoints/latest.json.tmp" as Tmp

== Save (after each completed turn) ==
AM -> CM: save(run_id, turn, agent_manager.snapshot())
CM -> CM: mkdir(checkpoints/, exist_ok=True)
CM -> CM: build CheckpointState(run_id, last_completed_turn=turn, agent_snapshot)
CM -> Tmp: write_text(state.model_dump_json())
CM -> Latest: tmp_path.replace(final_path)  ' atomic rename on POSIX
note right of Latest: overwrites any previous checkpoint\n(only the LATEST is ever kept)

== Resume (at run start) ==
participant Orchestrator as Orch
Orch -> CM: load(run_id)
CM -> Latest: check exists
alt no checkpoint file
    Latest --> CM: (does not exist)
    CM --> Orch: None  ' fresh run, start at turn 1
else checkpoint exists
    Latest --> CM: raw JSON
    CM -> CM: CheckpointState.model_validate_json(raw)
    alt schema-invalid / corrupted
        CM --> Orch: raise pydantic.ValidationError (uncaught, fatal)
    else valid
        CM --> Orch: CheckpointState (resume from last_completed_turn + 1)
    end
end
@enduml
